{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":496529,"name":"UCC3","username":"UCC3","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/u/f0a364/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-21T00:12:32.456Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496529-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496529-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496529-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496529-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSince last night (2026-09-20 evening KST / UTC+9), interactive Grok Bot chat cannot connect on both Windows desktop and my phone. The desktop app stays on Reconnecting, then shows Couldn’t reach Grok Bot’s computer with Recover / Retry.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRoutines keep running normally. Plenty of usage remaining on Cursor Ultra. This is not a quota or local-network issue — the same failure happens on phone data/Wi-Fi and Windows.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI have not clicked Recover or Reset. Retry is reported to freeze the app, so I have not pressed it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease recover/reattach the existing Agent Computer on the backend. Keep bots, files, chats, and logins. Do not reset or recreate it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496529-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496529-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot on Windows 10 and sign in with this Ultra account.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe app stays on Reconnecting, then shows Couldn’t reach Grok Bot’s computer.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot on the phone with the same account. Same unreachable-computer state.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConfirm scheduled routines still run while chat cannot send.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDo not click Recover / Reset / Retry (Retry is reported to freeze the app).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496529-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496529-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe existing Agent Computer should reconnect on desktop and phone so I can chat again. Routines already prove the cloud side is at least partly alive. Recover/Reset should not be required.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496529-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496529-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/5/9/5957e107e7984a87cc106b9344b8c783dde20821.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/cKmM2ovIgB9a1jB5CB04tUrYwvf.png?dl=1\" title=\"c__Users_ucc3_AppData_Roaming_Cursor_User_workspaceStorage_d4caacf1eb52a5e607d85e545908cc44_images_image-f6f2d800-2467-402b-b5e7-87bfa9ee820d.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/5/9/5957e107e7984a87cc106b9344b8c783dde20821_2_493x500.png\" alt=\"c__Users_ucc3_AppData_Roaming_Cursor_User_workspaceStorage_d4caacf1eb52a5e607d85e545908cc44_images_image-f6f2d800-2467-402b-b5e7-87bfa9ee820d.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"cKmM2ovIgB9a1jB5CB04tUrYwvf\" width=\"493\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/5/9/5957e107e7984a87cc106b9344b8c783dde20821_2_493x500.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/5/9/5957e107e7984a87cc106b9344b8c783dde20821.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/5/9/5957e107e7984a87cc106b9344b8c783dde20821.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"161616\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003ec__Users_ucc3_AppData_Roaming_Cursor_User_workspaceStorage_d4caacf1eb52a5e607d85e545908cc44_images_image-f6f2d800-2467-402b-b5e7-87bfa9ee820d.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e646×654 19.2 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496529-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496529-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003cbr\u003e\nOther\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496529-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496529-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot desktop on Windows 10 (build 19045).\u003cbr\u003e\nPhone app also fails with the same unreachable-computer error.\u003cbr\u003e\nCannot copy About Grok Bot version because the computer never becomes reachable.\u003cbr\u003e\nCursor account plan: Ultra. Privacy Mode: Active.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496529-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496529-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot (not Cursor IDE). Interactive chat cannot start, so no model picker is available.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496529-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496529-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: add Request ID with privacy disabled\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo request ID. Interactive messages cannot be sent. Computer never becomes reachable.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496529-additional-information-10\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496529-additional-information-10\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccount email: \u003ca href=\"mailto:ub.ucc3@gmail.com\"\u003eub.ucc3@gmail.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nPlan: Cursor Ultra\u003cbr\u003e\nPrivacy Mode: Active\u003cbr\u003e\nTimezone: Asia/Seoul (KST)\u003cbr\u003e\nStarted: 2026-09-20 evening KST (still down as of 2026-09-21 ~09:00 KST)\u003cbr\u003e\nDevices: Windows 10 and phone, both fail\u003cbr\u003e\nRoutines: still running\u003cbr\u003e\nUsage: plenty remaining, not a quota issue\u003cbr\u003e\nRecover / Reset: not used\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLooks like the Sep 20 Agent Computer rehydrate/attach bug some users reported. Please unstick/reattach this account’s computer on your side.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-496529-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-11\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-496529-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-11\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-21T00:12:46.374Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":1,"readers_count":0,"score":0,"yours":false,"topic_id":172453,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-unreachable-on-windows-and-phone-since-sep-20-evening-kst-routines-still-run","display_username":"UCC3","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges